# 本工程是 Windows 下的嵌入式固件：保持文件字节原样，不做 CRLF 转换，
# 避免一次 checkout 就改掉所有源码行尾（固件源码、生成字库数组都按原字节比对）。
* -text

# 二进制素材/文档不做文本 diff（加速 status/diff，并防止误合并）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.stl binary
*.3mf binary
*.step binary
*.stp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.bin binary
